{"unit_id":"Rhongomyniadz__dsh-aemeath-skin#readme-1","repo":"Rhongomyniadz/dsh-aemeath-skin","commit":"74bc48b716dd31d1e77f2c74127ffab3f1cea995","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/dsh-client-ui-skin-aemeath README · dsh-aemeath-skin · 爱弥斯：DeepSeek Harness Web GUI 皮肤：**爱弥斯主题**。\n\n- 对话区背景：`assets/chat.webp`\n- 侧栏背景：`assets/sidebar.webp`\n- 对话右上角角色立绘：`assets/chat-companion.webp`（源图 `chat-companion.png`，\n  构建脚本内嵌的是 webp；替换后重新 build 即可）\n- 粉色主色 + 深莓紫玻璃面板 + 电光粉信号线 + HUD 角标","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-aemeath-skin · 爱弥斯"}
{"unit_id":"Rhongomyniadz__dsh-aemeath-skin#readme-2","repo":"Rhongomyniadz/dsh-aemeath-skin","commit":"74bc48b716dd31d1e77f2c74127ffab3f1cea995","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/dsh-client-ui-skin-aemeath README · 安装：```sh\ncd <harness>\ndsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/dsh-aemeath-skin\n```\n\n重启 `dsh web` 后，在 profile 与 home 两个 patch 层中：\n\n```yaml\n- id: ui-skin-aemeath\n  disabled: false\n```","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"Rhongomyniadz__dsh-aemeath-skin#readme-3","repo":"Rhongomyniadz/dsh-aemeath-skin","commit":"74bc48b716dd31d1e77f2c74127ffab3f1cea995","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/dsh-client-ui-skin-aemeath README · 素材与构建：`lib/` 是提交的分发产物，由 `scripts/build.mjs` 从 `src/` 与 `assets/`\n确定性重组（无外部依赖、无远程资源）：\n\n```sh\nnpm run build\n```\n\n替换 `assets/chat.webp` / `assets/sidebar.webp` 后重新 build 即可换背景图。\n爱心声痕 SVG 在 `src/client/art.js` 中，可按需调整。","source":"extracted","section":"素材与构建"}
